@prefix eco:<https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#>. @prefix skos:<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>.
eco:ReleaseTagValidation a eco:GovernanceInvariant,skos:Concept;skos:prefLabel "producer release tag validation";skos:definition "A producer release tag must match the admitted stable version syntax before installation.";eco:falsifier "Installing an invalid release tag without refusal falsifies this invariant.".
